  ],
  "exercise_count": 12,
  "prose": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "完成等量的机械功，使用不同的动力，所需的时间可能不同。\n本教材举例说，在建筑工地上，用起重机几分钟就可以把几百块砖送到楼的上层。\n这些砖若由一个工人来背，就要干整整一个工作日。\n\n本教材还比较了马和拖拉机耕地的用时。\n一匹好马在10–12 小时内可以耕1公顷土地。\n配备多铧犁的拖拉机在40–50 分钟内就能完成同样的工作。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 175,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0186#3"
      ],
      "source_text": "用不同的动力来完成等量的机械功，所需的时间是不同的. 例如，在建筑工地上用起重机可以把几百块砖在几分钟内就送到楼的上层去. 而这些砖若由一个工人来背，他就要干整整一个工作日. 又如一匹好马在10—12 小时内可以耕1公顷土地，而配备着多铧犁的拖拉机在40—50 分钟内就能完成这么多工作.",
      "changes": [
        "wording",
        "layout",
        "source-attribution"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "做等量的功时，起重机比工人用时短，拖拉机比马用时短。\n工程技术中用**功率**这个物理量来描述做功的快慢。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 175,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0186#4"
      ],
      "source_text": "很明显，在做等量的功时，起重机比工人快，拖拉机比马快. 在工程技术中就用一个叫做功率的专门物理量来描写做功的快慢.",
      "changes": [
        "wording",
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "**我们把在数值上等于单位时间内所做的功的物理量，叫做功率。**",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 175,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0186#5"
      ],
      "source_text": "**我们把在数值上与单位时间内所做的功相等的量叫做功****率.**",
      "changes": [
        "wording",
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "功率表示单位时间内所做功的多少，可以把它看成“做功的速度”。\n这里说的是做功的快慢，不是物体运动的速度。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 175,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0186#6"
      ],
      "source_text": "功率表示的是单位时间内所做功的多少，可以把功率看成是做功的速度.",
      "changes": [
        "wording",
        "layout",
        "scope-clarification"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "**计算功率时，要用功除以做这个功所用的时间：**",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 175,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0186#7"
      ],
      "source_text": "**要计算功率，需将功除以做这个功所用的时间：**",
      "changes": [
        "wording",
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "**功率**$=\\frac{\\textbf{功}}{\\textbf{时间}}$，或$N=\\frac{A}{t}$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 175,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0186#8"
      ],
      "source_text": "**功率**$=\\frac{\\textbf{功}}{\\textbf{时间}}$，或$N=\\frac{A}{t}$",
      "changes": [
        "wording",
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$N$是功率，$A$是功，$t$是做功的时间。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 175,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0186#9"
      ],
      "source_text": "式中 $N$——功率，$A$——功，$t$——做功的时间.",
      "changes": [
        "wording",
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "**把单位时间内完成单位功的功率，取作功率的单位。**",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 175,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0186#10"
      ],
      "source_text": "**我们把单位时间内完成单位功的功率取做功率的单位.**",
      "changes": [
        "wording",
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "如果功的单位取焦耳，时间的单位取秒，功率的单位就是焦耳/秒。\n这个单位叫做**瓦特**，简称瓦。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 175,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0186#11"
      ],
      "source_text": "若把功的单位取为焦耳，时间的单位取为秒，则功率的单位即为焦耳/秒. 这个单位叫做**瓦特**. （简称为瓦.）",
      "changes": [
        "wording",
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "**1 瓦特**$=\\frac{\\textbf{1 焦耳}}{\\textbf{1 秒}}$，**或 1 瓦特$=$1焦/秒。\n**",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 176,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0187#1"
      ],
      "source_text": "**1 瓦特**$=\\frac{\\textbf{1 焦耳}}{\\textbf{1 秒}}$，**或 1 瓦特$=$1 焦/秒.**",
      "changes": [
        "wording",
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "在工程技术中，还使用千瓦、兆瓦、马力等较大的功率单位。\n1 千瓦$=1000$瓦特，1 兆瓦$=1000000$瓦特，按本教材采用的换算，1 马力$=736$瓦特。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 176,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0187#2"
      ],
      "source_text": "在工程技术中广泛地使用着另一些大得多的功率单位——千瓦、兆瓦、马力等. 1 千瓦$=1000$ 瓦特；1 兆瓦$=1000000$ 瓦特；1 马力$=736$ 瓦特.",
      "changes": [
        "wording",
        "layout",
        "source-attribution",
        "scope-clarification"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "例题：水流从堤坝落下，落差为25米，每分钟流过120米$^3$的水。\n求这股水流的功率。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 176,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0187#3"
      ],
      "source_text": "例题　试求流过堤坝的水流的功率，已知水的落差为25米，流量是每分钟120 米$^3$.",
      "changes": [
        "wording",
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "**解：**",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 176,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0187#4"
      ],
      "source_text": "**解：**",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "1 分钟内落下的水的质量由下式计算：\n$m=\\rho V$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 176,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0187#5"
      ],
      "source_text": "1 分钟内落下的水的质量是 $m=\\rho V$，",
      "changes": [
        "wording",
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$m=1000$千克/米$^3\\times120$米$^3=120000$千克。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 176,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0187#6"
      ],
      "source_text": "$m=1000$ 千克/米$^3\\times120$ 米$^3=120000$ 千克.",
      "changes": [
        "wording",
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "这部分水所受的重力为：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 176,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0187#7"
      ],
      "source_text": "作用在这部分水上的重力为",
      "changes": [
        "wording",
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$F=9.8$牛顿/千克$\\times120000$千克$\\approx1200000$牛顿。\n这里沿用教材对重力的近似取值，以下计算也使用这一取整值。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 176,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0187#8"
      ],
      "source_text": "$F=9.8$ 牛顿/千克$\\times120000$ 千克$\\approx1200000$ 牛顿.",
      "changes": [
        "wording",
        "layout",
        "source-attribution",
        "scope-clarification"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "因此，水流在1分钟内所做的功由下式计算：\n$A=Fh$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 176,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0187#9"
      ],
      "source_text": "故水流在1 分钟内所做的功为 $A=Fh$，",
      "changes": [
        "wording",
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$A=1200000$牛顿$\\times25$米$=30000000$焦耳。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 176,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0187#10"
      ],
      "source_text": "$A=1200000$ 牛顿$\\times25$ 米$=30000000$ 焦耳.",
      "changes": [
        "wording",
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "水流的功率为$N=\\frac{A}{t}$。\n这一段做功时间为$t=1$分钟$=60$秒。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 176,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0187#11"
      ],
      "source_text": "水流的功率 $N=\\frac{A}{t}$；而 $t=1$ 分钟$=60$ 秒，",
      "changes": [
        "wording",
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "因此：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 176,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0187#12"
      ],
      "source_text": "故",
      "changes": [
        "wording",
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$N=\\frac{30000000\\text{焦耳}}{60\\text{秒}}=500000$瓦特$=0.5$兆瓦。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 176,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0187#13"
      ],
      "source_text": "$N=\\frac{30000000\\text{焦耳}}{60\\text{秒}}=500000$ 瓦特$=0.5$ 兆瓦.",
      "changes": [
        "wording",
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "本教材介绍，发动机的功率相差很大：小的只有百分之几甚至千分之几千瓦，例如电动刮脸刀和缝纫机上的电动机，大的可达几十万千瓦，例如水轮机和汽轮机。\n教材说明，每台发动机都有一个小牌子，叫做**铭牌**，上面列有几项相关数据。\n功率就是铭牌中的一项数据。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 176,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0187#14"
      ],
      "source_text": "各种不同的发动机的功率也很不相同，小的只有百分之几甚至千分之几千瓦（如电动刮脸刀和缝纫机上用的电动机），大的可达几十万千瓦（如水轮机和汽轮机）. 每台发动机上都有一个小牌子（铭牌），上面写着有关该发动机的几项数据，功率就是其中的一项.",
      "changes": [
        "wording",
        "layout",
        "source-attribution"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "按本教材给出的数据，人在正常工作条件下工作时的功率平均为70–80 瓦特。\n人在跳跃或跑上楼梯时，功率可达730瓦特左右。\n教材也指出，某些情况下还可能更大。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 176,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0187#15",
        "p0188#1"
      ],
      "source_text": "人在正常工作条件下工作时的功率平均为70—80 瓦特.当人跳跃时或跑上楼梯时的功率可达730 瓦特左右. 在一些个别的场合，功率甚至还可以更大些.",
      "changes": [
        "wording",
        "layout",
        "source-attribution",
        "scope-clarification"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "cap",
      "text": "**本教材的发动机功率举例**（单位：千瓦）",
      "id": null,
      "label": "表",
      "printed_page": 177,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0188#2"
      ],
      "source_text": "**发动机功率举例**（单位：千瓦）",
      "changes": [
        "wording",
        "layout",
        "source-attribution"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "text": "",
      "id": "tbl-p0188-01",
      "label": "表",
