      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "在发动机以给定功率工作时，知道它的功率和工作的时间，就可以计算所做的功。\n由公式$N=\\frac{A}{t}$可得：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 177,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0188#4"
      ],
      "source_text": "知道了发动机的功率，就可以计算这台发动机在任一段时间间隔内所做的功. 由公式 $N=\\frac{A}{t}$ 可得",
      "changes": [
        "wording",
        "layout",
        "scope-clarification"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$A=Nt$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 177,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0188#5"
      ],
      "source_text": "$A=Nt$.",
      "changes": [
        "wording",
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "例题：电风扇电动机的功率为35瓦特。\n求它在10分钟内所做的功。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 177,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0188#6"
      ],
      "source_text": "例题　电风扇上的电动机的功率为35 瓦特，试求电动机在10 分钟内所做的功.",
      "changes": [
        "wording",
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "**解：**\n$A=Nt$，",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 177,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0188#7"
      ],
      "source_text": "**解：**　　　　　$A=Nt$，",
      "changes": [
        "wording",
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$A=35\\text{ 瓦特}\\times600\\text{ 秒}=21000\\text{ 瓦特}\\cdot\\text{秒}=21000\\text{ 焦耳}=21\\text{ 千焦耳}$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 177,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0188#8"
      ],
      "source_text": "$A=35\\text{ 瓦特}\\times600\\text{ 秒}=21000\\text{ 瓦特}\\cdot\\text{秒}=21000\\text{ 焦耳}=21\\text{ 千焦耳}$.",
      "changes": [
        "wording",
        "layout"
      ],
